{"3557550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final District", "steam_appid": 3557550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautiful planet of Kepler-11e and discover the mysteries of this abandoned mining planet!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/ae5211c96b2e330d872cda1ce1036811.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against increasingly difficult hordes of enemies while upgrading weapons and collecting care packages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/9b87d4bb21b1c30354060d4a0a257cad.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dummy Practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your aim by releasing fire on a set of innocent training dummies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/81562761ba2e4c640154b1f7157b9f93.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture The Flag</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to 3 other players in free for all capture the flag where the player with the most flags wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/8652ec283b14df93b68642d12947e607.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deathmatch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to 3 other players in free for all deathmatch where the player with the most kills wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/11bed39f00eff5514159483c39c4d8a1.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautiful planet of Kepler-11e and discover the mysteries of this abandoned mining planet!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/ae5211c96b2e330d872cda1ce1036811.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horde Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against increasingly difficult hordes of enemies while upgrading weapons and collecting care packages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/9b87d4bb21b1c30354060d4a0a257cad.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dummy Practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your aim by releasing fire on a set of innocent training dummies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/81562761ba2e4c640154b1f7157b9f93.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture The Flag</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to 3 other players in free for all capture the flag where the player with the most flags wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/8652ec283b14df93b68642d12947e607.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deathmatch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge up to 3 other players in free for all deathmatch where the player with the most kills wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/extras/11bed39f00eff5514159483c39c4d8a1.avif?t=1762248950\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Landing on planet Kepler-11e, You and up to 3 other players are tasked with preventing this previously abandoned planet from complete destruction as rogue AI mysteriously activate. Upgrade weapons and eliminate any aliens in your way in this realistic, first-person, sci-fi experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/439712cbf7d5404dade74432392fa8f7129ddee9/header.jpg?t=1762248950", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/fc1eb13d662e38273c09fd74235d5838aaae85f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762248950", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557550/fc1eb13d662e38273c09fd74235d5838aaae85f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762248950", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL CORE I5-8400 or AMD RYZEN 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB or AMD Radeon RX 570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS